{{Quote|One of the three Legendary Swords, infused with a soul.|Item}}
'''Oroshi''' (formerly known as '''Wando''') is a {{Legendary}} [[sword]].

Usually regarded as weak among the legendary swords, Oroshi does not possess any remarkable traits, usually only being used to obtain the [[True Triple Katana]] or farm levels. However, it does have decent damage and stun.

==Obtainment==
{{Main|Legendary Sword Dealer}}
Oroshi can be bought at the price of {{Money|2,000,000}} from the [[Legendary Sword Dealer]].

